[[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Lift up the nut cover.</p><p>2. Undo the nut.</p><p>3. Remove the wiper arm.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035348.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the wiper arm and\nthe blade are not damaged.</p><p>Refit the wiper arm fixing it with the\nnut.</p><p>Fit the nut cover.</p><p>Check that the windscreen wiper is working\nproperly.</p>"]]